SecAssist packages and wires LibreChat (https://github.com/danny-avila/LibreChat) as the
governed AI chat UI of the SecRouter suite — signed in via SecSSO (OIDC) and routed through
SecRouter for per-user governance. LibreChat is a third-party project distributed under its
own license (MIT); it is not included in this repository — its container images are pulled
at deploy time. MongoDB and Meilisearch are likewise third-party images pulled at deploy.

The only original code vendored here is the small zero-dependency SecRouter auth proxy
under proxy/ (Apache-2.0, as above).
